1. User clicks on link

2. User allows camera access

3. User watches the live motion tracking analysis of their body features. 
There will be circles on joints and lines that connect them accordingly.

4. User views popups with feedback: ““Keep elbow under the ball”, “Bend knees more”, “Good follow-through”,  
“Shoulders not aligned”. These feedback will all layer as objects in the top right of the screen. 
They pop up when an algorithm is set. They disappear if form is satisfactory.
If all popups are gone, a popup shows in green, stating their form is satisfactory (good form!)

5. User is free to exit out the link

